// Paste into Deneb's "Edit dataset" (DAX) panel for the ROC curve visual.
// Returns fpr/tpr sorted ascending -- Deneb/Vega-Lite plots every row as its own
// point with no forced aggregation, so duplicate fpr values (the vertical steps
// of a real ROC curve) render correctly instead of being summed together like
// the native Power BI line chart did.
EVALUATE
SELECTCOLUMNS(
    roc_curve,
    "fpr", roc_curve[fpr],
    "tpr", roc_curve[tpr]
)
ORDER BY [fpr]
